<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">2 Thessalonikate</book>
  <para style="h">2 Thessalonikate</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Thessalonikate</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thessalonikate</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Thessalonikate</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Silvana leh Timothi in, Pathian i Pa leh Toupa Jesu Khrist a Thessalonika khua a saptuamte kiang ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pa Pathian leh Toupa Jesu Khrist kiang a kipan hehpihna leh lemna na kiang uah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Unaute aw, na ginna uh nakpitak a khanglian in, navek ua na ki-ittuah chiatna uh a khan semsem ziak in noumau tungthu ah Pathian kiang a kipahthu gengen ding him ka hi uh: huai ka hihtuak him uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huchi in min a honsawina tengteng uleh gim na thuaknate ua na kuhkal dan uleh na ginna ziak un Pathian saptuam pawlte lak ah kou k’on suang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huai Pathian vaihawmna a diktat chih chiamtehna ahi a, Pathian kumpi gam ziak a na thuak uh leng tu a kumpi gammi a sehtak na hi uh chih kilatna semsem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian in nou hon hihgimte gimthuakna a thuk diktathuai in a septa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Toupa Jesu van a kipan a angel hatte toh meikuanga hong kilak chiang a, nou hihgima omte kou toh khawlna a honpe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian theilou mi leh i Toupa Jesu Tanchinhoih taksangloute tung a phu a la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amau tangtawn manthatna a gawtna leh Toupa omna leh a thilhihtheihna thupina a kipan a pawsiahna a thuak ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah a hongpai chiang in misiangthoute hihthupi in a om ding ua, gingtute tengteng lamdangsak a om ding uhi, k’on thu theihsak uh na gintak ziak un nou leng amaute lak ah na telsam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huchi a hihthupi leh lamdang sak a hih theihna ding a i Pathian in nou a honsapna a saptuak him a honsak theihna ding in leh, hoih utna chiteng leh ginna nasep chiteng a thilhihtheihna a hon lohchinsak theihna ding in nou adin k’on thumsak gige uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi a i Pathian leh Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna bangzel a i Toupa Jesu min noumau a hihthupi a om a, noumau leng amah a hihthupi a na om theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himahleh unaute aw, i Toupa Jesu Khrist hongpaina leh amah tuakdinga i vakikhopna ding thu ah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Toupa ni a tungkhinta chihna kha in hiam aw, thu ziak in hiam aw, kou a kipan a laikhak ziak in hiam aw, na lungsim uh a linpah louhna ding in leh na buailouhna ding un k’on ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kuamah in bangmah in honkhem kei uhen; puksannatak a hongtun masak phot a, khelhna mipa, mangthang tapa ngei a hong kilat kei leh huai ni tunglou ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah Pathian a hihsak peuhmah uleh, sabiak tengteng dou in, a tung ua om tum in a kihihthupi ding: huchi in Pathian tempula tuin Pathian bang hial in a kitung khe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lak ua ka omlai in leng huaibang thu k’on hilh zel chih na theigige kei ua hia?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah hun tuam a a hong kilat theihna ding in bang in kham hiam chih na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Danlou a omna thuguk in tuin leng a sem lellel ngal a, himahleh lakmang a a om masiah tua a khampa’n huchibang in a kham ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huai lakmang chiang in dan a talekpa a hong kilangta dia, Toupa Jesu’n a kam hatna in a that dia, a hongpaina leh kilakna in a hihmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai dan a talekpa a hongpaina Setan sepdan bangzel in, thilhihtheihna chiteng, chiamtehna chiteng, zuau thillamdang chiteng toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangthang lelte ding in khemna gilou chiteng toh ahi ding; hotdam a a om theihna ding ua thutak itna a pomlouh ziak un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huaiziak in zuauthu a gintakna ding un, Pathian in diklouhna nasep a kiang uah a honsawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thutak gingtalou a diktatlouhna a kipak zawte’n siamlouh a tanvek theihna ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unau Toupa ngaihtakte aw, Kha hihsiangthou leh thutak gingta a hotdam a om ding in a tung a kipan Pathian in nou a hontel ziak in na tungthu uah zaw Pathian kiang ah kipahthu genzel ding him ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huchibang ding in aman i Toupa Jesu Khrist thupina tang ding in ka Tangchinhoih un nou a honsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huchi in unaute aw, ding kip unla, kam a ka thugen uleh laikhakte a nou k’on sinsakte uh lenkip un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huchi in i Toupa Jesu Khrist mahmah leh Pathian i Pa, eite honitpa leh hehpihna ziak a tangtawn a khamuanna leh lametna hoih hon pepan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungtangte uh hih khamuangin, thil hoih hih leh thugen chiteng ah hon hihkip hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tawppen in unaute aw, Toupa thu noumau lak a a om bang in, khang a hihthupia a om theihna ding leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migenhakte leh migiloute lak a ka bit theihna ding un, hon thumsak un; mi tengteng in lah ginna a neivek kei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Himahleh Toupa a muanhuai a, aman noute hon phutkip in gilou apan a honveng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />K’on thupiak peuhmah uh na hihzou ua, na hih zelzel u leng Toupa ah k’on gingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Toupa’n na lungtangte uh Pathian itna ah leh Khrist kuhkalna ah pilut hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huan unaute aw, koute a kipan a thuhilhna a muh bang ua omlou nasep thadah, danlou bang a om unau tengteng apan kihemkhe ding in i Toupa Jesu Khrist min in thu ka honpia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kiang ua ka omlai un, danlou bang in ka gamta ngeikei uh chih leh noumau mahmah in n’on zuihdan ding uh na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kuamah khut a kipan a thawn in na tanghou uh leng ka ne ngeikei uhi; noute k’on tuailuai saklouhna ding un sun leh zana gim leh tawltaka semkawm in ka ne zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai thuneihna ka neihlouh ziak uh hilou in, ka omdan uh na zuih ding ua etton ding honpia ka hi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na kiang ua ka omlai un: kuapeuh in nna a sepnop kei leh a nek leng ne kei hen, chi in thu ka honpia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lak ua khenkhat danlou a omte tungtang ka za uhi, huaite’n na himhim a semkei ua, midangte nasep ah a kichinglah zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Huchi a hih chiang in, huai mite nasem hiathiat ding leh amau tanghou ne ding in Toupa Jesu Khrist ah thupia in ka hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Unaute aw, nou zaw thil hoih hih chimtak kei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Huan kuapeuh in hiai ka laikhak ua ka thu uh a zuih kei uleh, na kithuahpih hetlouhna ding un chiamteh un, a zum theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi, melma bang in enkei unla, unau bang in hilhzaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Huan muanna Toupa’n tangtawn in banglam peuh ah nou hon khamuan hen. Toupa na vek ua lak ah om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei, Paul in, keimah khut a hiai chibaibukna ka gelh ahi; hiai ka laikhak teng ah chiamtehna ahi; hichibang ka gelh dan ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I Toupa Jesu Khrist hehpihna na vek ua kiang ah om hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
